{"id": "bdcdd4ee-aa46-4c05-b334-1c2df789bdbc", "title": {"en": "Planetary Systems", "es": "Sistemas planetarios", "pt": "Sistema Planet\u00e1rios"}, "card": {"foregroundColor": {"blue": 1, "green": 1, "opacity": 1, "red": 1}, "image": "", "imageStyle": "textFirst", "localizedTitle": {"en": "### Planetary Systems", "es": "### Sistemas planetarios", "pt": "### Sistema Planet\u00e1rios"}}, "pages": [{"id": "95cae450-b245-4e6f-9ab9-6b9c5c374f57", "blocks": [{"id": "7d4c4664-ed7c-4454-b33b-444378c26181", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Galapagos Island", "es": "## Islas Gal\u00e1pagos", "pt": "## Ilhas Gal\u00e1pagos"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "360a43c7-9073-49a1-8350-545d35075d94", "height": "huge", "image": "", "type": "image"}, {"id": "2ebee12d-b5b5-4bb7-b663-23ec0ce05919", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Let\u2019s listen to 2 hours of Earth System noise recorded on the Galapagos\nIslands.\n\nThe octaves higher is set to **8** and the volume is increased.\nNote that you can change both the octaves higher, by using the **Change**\ntext button that shows when the sound isn\u2019t playing, and the volume, by\nclicking the circular button on the bottom left of the sound track.\n\nThis volume button has two settings: \n  * fixed volume (*small wave*)\n  * auto-adjusted volume (*large wave* that fills the button)\n", "es": "Escucha 2 horas de ruido del sistema terrestre grabado en las Islas Gal\u00e1pagos.\n\nEl incremento de octavas se establece en **8** y se aumenta el volumen.\nTen en cuenta que puedes cambiar ambas opciones usando el bot\u00f3n **Cambiar**\nen el lado derecho del texto **Incremento de octavas** debajo de la se\u00f1al\ny el bot\u00f3n circular con una onda en su interior.\n\nEste bot\u00f3n de volumen tiene dos posiciones: \n  * volumen fijo (*onda peque\u00f1a*)\n  * volumen auto-ajustado (*onda grande* que ocupa todo el bot\u00f3n)\n", "pt": "Vamos ouvir 2 horas de ru\u00eddo do Sistema Terrestre gravado nas Ilhas Gal\u00e1pagos.\n\nO incremento de oitavas est\u00e1 definido em **8** e o volume est\u00e1 aumentado.\nVale lembrar que voc\u00ea pode alterar tanto o incremento de oitavas, usando o bot\u00e3o **Mudar** \n(que aparece quando o som n\u00e3o est\u00e1 tocando), quanto o volume, clicando no bot\u00e3o circular no \ncanto inferior esquerdo da faixa de \u00e1udio.\n\nEsse bot\u00e3o de volume possui duas configura\u00e7\u00f5es:\n\n  * Volume fixo (*onda pequena*)\n  * Volume ajustado automaticamente (*onda grande* que ocupa todo o bot\u00e3o)\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "aa7f5eff-95fa-4146-8b50-5a3882eadf84", "octavesHigher": 256, "type": "localWave", "volumeModifier": "autoAdjusted", "waveData": {"duration": 7200, "startDate": "2020-01-13T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "example", "id": "32523B1B-3408-40B2-AF1A-033C9C5C4831", "latitude": -0.67, "longitude": -90.29, "name": "Galapagos", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "2010-05-05T00:00:00Z", "location": "10", "network": "IU", "station": "PAYG"}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "Pacific/Galapagos", "style": "byName"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}}}, {"id": "645e9038-71f8-4229-ad4d-0a90640fc70f", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}, {"id": "3c47b867-67b2-4b4c-abcc-91bdcd478784", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Image credit: ***NASA***", "es": "Cr\u00e9dito de la imagen: ***NASA***", "pt": "Cr\u00e9dito da imagem: ***NASA***"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}], "title": "P1.Galapagos"}, {"id": "fef2a8cc-6e5e-4f43-a8f4-ed5b6cdfe371", "blocks": [{"id": "5cf30a24-da4e-4bff-9fc8-fedb6957c2d0", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Antarctica", "es": "## Ant\u00e1rtida", "pt": "## Ant\u00e1rtica"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "dc8bda53-770b-4a0c-a833-9aad280769ea", "height": "huge", "image": "", "type": "image"}, {"id": "6a250131-c92f-451a-bfb0-7967f748b305", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Let\u2019s compare this background noise to the noise recorded during the same\ntwo hours in a different place: Antarctica. This noise is even less loud,\nso please make sure the volume is increased and the octaves higher is 8.\n", "es": "Compara este ruido de fondo con el ruido registrado durante las mismas\ndos horas en un lugar diferente: la Ant\u00e1rtida. Este ruido es todav\u00eda menos\nfuerte, as\u00ed que aseg\u00farate de que el volumen sea alto y que el incremento de\noctavas sea 8.\n", "pt": "Vamos comparar esse ru\u00eddo de fundo com o ru\u00eddo registrado durante as mesmas \nduas horas em outro lugar: a Ant\u00e1rtica. Esse ru\u00eddo \u00e9 ainda mais sutil, ent\u00e3o \ncertifique-se de que o volume est\u00e1 aumentado e o aumento de oitavas esteja em 8.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "3c0276b4-4fee-4191-a011-d780b7ddd0fd", "octavesHigher": 256, "type": "localWave", "volumeModifier": "autoAdjusted", "waveData": {"duration": 7200, "startDate": "2020-01-13T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "example", "id": "CA667295-E4B5-4597-8C38-EE16699FA84D", "latitude": -77.51, "longitude": 161.85, "name": "Antarctica Ross", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "2002-12-06T00:00:00Z", "location": "00", "network": "GT", "station": "VNDA"}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}}}, {"id": "5f38159e-3fde-4119-826c-3c9da0485bfc", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}, {"id": "c0f41bf0-5cfa-4b1a-9135-b0f5c8315712", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Image credit: ***NASA***", "es": "Cr\u00e9dito de la imagen: ***NASA***", "pt": "Cr\u00e9dito da imagem: ***NASA***"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}], "title": "P2.Antarctica_Ross"}, {"id": "94b8c47b-736d-4b90-be23-f5929f03d23d", "blocks": [{"id": "76038a8e-7db4-491b-9b23-4b7c4e24c979", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Mars", "es": "## Marte", "pt": "## Marte"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "ce0bb427-5735-4a11-a437-186794eb536a", "height": "huge", "image": "", "type": "image"}, {"id": "be82f451-27ce-4d7a-8712-84526c996a53", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Since January 2019 we can also listen to noise recorded by the InSight\nmission\u2019s seismometer on **Mars**!\n\nLet\u2019s listen to the exact same two hours of noise on Mars. Now you definitely \nneed to increase the volume given that Mars is a quieter planet overall. Don\u2019t \nforget to check that the octaves higher is 8.\n", "es": "\u00a1Desde enero de 2019 tambi\u00e9n podemos escuchar el ruido registrado por el\nsism\u00f3metro de la misi\u00f3n InSight en **Marte**!\n\nEscucha exactamente las mismas dos horas de ruido en Marte. Definitivamente,\nahora necesitas aumentar el volumen, dado que Marte es un planeta mucho m\u00e1s\nsilencioso en general. No olvides comprobar que el incremento de octavas sea\n8.\n", "pt": "Desde janeiro de 2019, tamb\u00e9m podemos ouvir os ru\u00eddos registrados pelo \nsism\u00f4metro da miss\u00e3o InSight em **Marte**!\n\nVamos ouvir exatamente as mesmas duas horas de ru\u00eddo em Marte. Agora voc\u00ea \ndefinitivamente precisa aumentar o volume, j\u00e1 que Marte \u00e9, no geral, um planeta \nmais silencioso. N\u00e3o se esque\u00e7a de verificar se o incremento de oitavas est\u00e1 em 8.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "9eb7a693-6b87-4b61-b085-57527dd1eb93", "octavesHigher": 256, "type": "localWave", "volumeModifier": "autoAdjusted", "waveData": {"duration": 7200, "startDate": "2020-01-13T00:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "user", "id": "43271E16-4629-4299-9C1F-7E8BBCB565A0", "name": "Mars InSight", "periods": [{"channel": "BHW", "location": "02", "network": "XB", "planet": "mars", "station": "ELYSE"}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}, "timeLatency": 0}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}}}, {"id": "11ada5db-b50b-4cab-a8a0-2c16b93b5d03", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}, {"id": "1d1bf1c9-2c26-4133-9b0b-26512fc11cbd", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Image credit: ***NASA***", "es": "Cr\u00e9dito de la imagen: ***NASA***", "pt": "Credito da imagem: ***NASA***"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}], "title": "P3.Mars"}, {"id": "170b23b5-817e-4ce8-b6b3-d29bb057b0fb", "blocks": [{"id": "b155d80d-3af3-4dc8-a196-c83629903b00", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Questions", "es": "## Preguntas", "pt": "## Perguntas"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "6812c215-9d36-4712-bb29-7abd3f134045", "height": "huge", "image": "", "type": "image"}, {"id": "2cf2816d-fe4a-4966-98bf-f70be085e578", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "**Question 1.** Do you think the interaction of ocean waves with islands and continents \ncontributes to these seismic signals?\n", "es": "**Pregunta 1.** \u00bfCrees que la interacci\u00f3n de las olas del oc\u00e9ano con las islas y los \ncontinentes contribuye a estas se\u00f1ales s\u00edsmicas?\n", "pt": "**Pergunta 1.** Voc\u00ea acha que a intera\u00e7\u00e3o das ondas mar\u00edtimas com as ilhas e continentes\ncontribui para esses sinais s\u00edsmicos?\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "229c69b4-3bac-4be1-9f6d-658b40753ea9", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Yes!\n", "es": "\u00a1S\u00ed!\n", "pt": "Sim!\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false, "unveil": {"unveilText": {"en": "Unveil answer", "es": "Desvelar respuesta", "pt": "Mostrar resposta"}, "waitingTime": 5}}, {"id": "b9486762-4f8b-487a-8bac-4b2c6b531b77", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "**Question 2.** Which place or planet would you like to listen to?\n", "es": "**Pregunta 2.** \u00bfQu\u00e9 lugar o planeta te gustar\u00eda escuchar?\n", "pt": "**Pergunta 2.** Que lugar ou planeta voc\u00ea gostaria de escutar?\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "a96ea8d1-57d1-474a-9b0e-ab5b8331bae2", "action": "close", "localizedText": {"en": "Close", "es": "Cerrar", "pt": "Fechar"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}, {"id": "ff8e5c5c-caff-429f-8048-e7f8919d87e7", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Image credit: ***NOAA***", "es": "Cr\u00e9dito de la imagen: ***NOAA***", "pt": "Cr\u00e9dito da imagem: ***NOAA***"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}], "title": "P4.Oceans"}]}